        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "A boat is 50 km due east of Brisbane at 3 p.m. It then travels in an easterly direction at 30 km/h.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "p13-q4-a-i",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "i",
            "prompt": "How far from Brisbane is the boat at 6 p.m.?",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$140\\text{ km}$",
              "worked": "The boat travels away from Brisbane for $6-3=3$ hours. Distance travelled = speed × time.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}d&=50+30\\times3\\\\d&=50+90\\\\d&=140\\text{ km}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 30
          },
          {
            "id": "p13-q4-a-ii",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "ii",
            "prompt": "How far from Brisbane is the boat after travelling for $n$ hours after 3 p.m.?",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$(50+30n)\\text{ km}$",
              "worked": "In $n$ hours the boat travels $30n$ km farther east, away from Brisbane.\n\n$$d=(50+30n)\\text{ km}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 20
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p13-q4-b",
        "type": "group",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "A boat is 500 km due east of Sydney at 11 a.m. It then travels in a westerly direction at 25 km/h.",
